{
  "info": {
    "name": "Lumina - Acceso y permisos",
    "description": "Colección del módulo de acceso y permisos (Sofía Gallego). RF-01, RF-02, RF-03 y RF-20.\n\nAntes de ejecutar:\n1. Encender el backend: `npm run dev` (en backend).\n2. Haber ejecutado `npm run db:seed`.\n3. En las variables de la colección, escribir `adminCorreo` y `adminContrasena` SOLO en la columna *Current value* (no se exportan ni se suben a Git).\n\nEjecutar las carpetas en orden (1 → 4). La carpeta 2 crea un docente real con un correo único `docente.demo.<número>@unihumboldt.edu.co`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminCorreo",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "adminContrasena",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenAdmin",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenDocente",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "docenteCorreo",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "docenteContrasena",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Ingreso del administrador",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Ingreso sin datos (400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/acceso/ingreso",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "acceso",
                "ingreso"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('responde 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Contraseña incorrecta (401)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/acceso/ingreso",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "acceso",
                "ingreso"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"{{adminCorreo}}\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"contrasena-incorrecta\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('responde 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "pm.test('mismo mensaje para correo o contraseña', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.eql('Correo o contraseña no válidos'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Ingreso del administrador (200)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/acceso/ingreso",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "acceso",
                "ingreso"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"{{adminCorreo}}\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"{{adminContrasena}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const datos = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('trae el rol Administrador', () => pm.expect(datos.usuario.roles).to.include('Administrador'));",
                  "pm.test('no devuelve el hash de la contraseña', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include('scrypt'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenAdmin', datos.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
